Global M5Timer.i,M5TimerFlag.i,M5TimerRun.i
Global M5SampleCycles.i,M5PcmArea.i
Global Dim M5PulseArea.i(2)
Global Dim M5PulseCarry.i(2)
Global Dim M5Prg.i(5)
Global Dim M5Chr.i(12)
Global Dim M5RamSlots.i(4)
Global Dim M5SpriteSlots.i(8)
Global Dim M5Ram.a(131072)
Global Dim M5Ex.a(1024)
Global Dim M5SoundReg.a(8)
